Task 3: Digital Vehicle Insurance Management System
Objective
Develop a Spring Boot application using JpaRepository to manage vehicle insurance records.
Entity Class: VehicleInsurance
Variables- Long insuranceId- String vehicleNumber- String ownerName- String insuranceCompany- Double premiumAmount
Methods- Getters and Setters- Constructors- toString()
Repository Interface: VehicleInsuranceRepository
public interface VehicleInsuranceRepository extends JpaRepository<VehicleInsurance, Long> {}
Service Class: VehicleInsuranceService
Methods- addPolicy(VehicleInsurance insurance)- addMultiplePolicies(List<VehicleInsurance> insuranceList)- getPolicyById(Long id)- getAllPolicies()- updatePolicy(VehicleInsurance insurance)- deletePolicy(Long id)- deleteAllPolicies()- countPolicies()- policyExists(Long id)
Requirements
1. Add a vehicle insurance policy using save().
2. Add multiple insurance policies using saveAll().
3. Display all policies using findAll().
4. Search policy by ID using findById().
5. Check policy existence using existsById().
6. Count total policies using count().
7. Update premium amount using save().
8. Delete a policy using deleteById().
9. Delete all policies using deleteAll().
Main Class
Implement all JpaRepository methods through CommandLineRunner and display the results in the
console